{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This game is currently in an Open Playtest. Joining it means you can play the full game for free, and see the project complete its final weeks of development in real time, before its launch on July 29th. Wishlist, provide your feedback, and look forward to a minimum of two months of post-launch support!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/1fa8bbcc413459268adfed26af884325.avif?t=1752687943\" /></div><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1752687943\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.webm?t=1752687943\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.mp4?t=1752687943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this absurdist online multiplayer horror game, 2-4 of your favorite people (or more, if you want to risk your computers/sanity) must use traps, proximity voice chat, and Gregorian chanting among other tools to feed giant monsters known as 'kaiju', gather treasure, and prevent the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't stay in the Larder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.poster.avif?t=1752687943\" aria-label=\"Gif showing monks running around a huge room filled with stairs and columns\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.webm?t=1752687943\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/018c620d0634f3b1735dcf6c13f1c00e.mp4?t=1752687943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flexible tag-based cooking system. Chop ingredients, salt them, burn them--and then fire them into a kaiju's jaws!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story about grappling with your faith as your leaders begin to die off, leaving you to carry the torch, told across 13 levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first-ever multiplayer project from the developers behind Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/4e6740f694d6e422e07e45caacf1cbc5.avif?t=1752687943\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139570?t=1752687943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139570?t=1752687943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/cf4afba67616387f07961e610f1c64a7044eacbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752687943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/cf4afba67616387f07961e610f1c64a7044eacbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752687943","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This game is currently in an Open Playtest. Joining it means you can play the full game for free, and see the project complete its final weeks of development in real time, before its launch on July 29th. Wishlist, provide your feedback, and look forward to a minimum of two months of post-launch support!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/1fa8bbcc413459268adfed26af884325.avif?t=1752687943\" /></div><strong>Co-Op Kaiju Horror Cooking</strong> is exactly what the name suggests. You and your friends are medieval monks, chefs--and walking liabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/e8d8d9dcaff2a11630fd0639af0dbdc9.poster.avif?t=1752687943\" aria-label=\"Gif of monks running down stairs and then all crowded around a sheet of paper\" ><source src=\"http