d Clickolding and I Am Your Beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dramatic medieval soundtrack by award-winning composer David Mason (Dredge, Creepy Redneck Dinosaur Mansion 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run away from monstrous creatures--and when necessary, turn them into food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No tomatoes, since they were only introduced to Europe in the 16th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/extras/4e6740f694d6e422e07e45caacf1cbc5.avif?t=1752687943\" /></div></p>","developers":["Strange Scaffold"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139570/e39a5192345e018d461b937e628a3ef39cf6d81a/header.jpg?t=1752687943","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Strange Scaffold","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257166663,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166663/movie480.mp4?t=1752670571","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166663/movie_max.mp4?t=1752670571"},"name":"Co-op Kaiju Horror Cooking Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166663/f69cb2735797d00b575a5fef0f97eb73ac7a560f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752670571","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166663/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752670571","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166663/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752670571"}}],"name":"Co-op Kaiju Horror Cooking","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350 or higher, or versi